      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned Ingest agent child process, immediately before that process starts**. \n\nThe key point is that the key is never held in the Hub\u0027s own process environment \u2014 instead, a local secrets loader reads it from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup and injects it solely into the child process\u0027s environment. The same approach applies to the Query agent as well: it also receives the credential injected into its own environment at spawn time, never inherited from the Hub\u0027s process environment.",
